# Dictation over art (Boss, 2026-10-30): a widget over an art panel, "MG1 / Press to record"; a tap on the art opens the
# listening screen for MG1; Send types there, and a failure keeps the words. The real `over`, ArtOverlay, dictation(...),
# ListeningLayer and ListeningRequest, in a fixture: a fictional picture, a fictional microphone (the emulator has none)
# and a fictional MG1. Nothing reaches a device. Phone C's widget and overlay look come from their cards.
# 1. Typed.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget typed
expect MG1
expect Press to record
nolog fixture dictation open
shot dictation-over-art-cover
tap Press to record
log fixture dictation open
expect Listening
expect turn the lights down
nolog fixture relay
shot dictation-listening-cover
tap 0.5 0.3
expect Send this?
expect turn the lights down
expect MG1
nolog fixture relay
shot dictation-heard-cover
tap Send
log fixture relay: turn the lights down
expect Typed into Brave on MG1
shot dictation-typed-cover
# 2. MG1 locked: said so, and the words stay, even after a tap on the paper. Cancel still drops them.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget locked
tap Press to record
tap 0.5 0.3
tap Send
log fixture relay: turn the lights down
expect MG1 is locked. Not typed.
expect turn the lights down
tap 0.5 0.3
expect MG1 is locked. Not typed.
expect turn the lights down
shot dictation-locked-cover
tap Cancel
absent turn the lights down
# 3. MG1 offline, unfolded.
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget offline
tap Press to record
tap 0.5 0.3
tap Send
expect MG1 is offline. Not typed.
expect turn the lights down
shot dictation-offline-unfolded
fold folded
# 4. Any other widget (Boss, 2026-10-30): its tap opens nothing.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget other
tap Press to record
log dictation is only for the widget in dictation-mg1.owl
nolog fixture dictation open
absent Listening
shot dictation-refused-cover
[phone] After the bundle, with Boss expecting it and MG1 on a text field: Page 2's cat keeps moving under "MG1 / Press to record". Tap it: the MG1 overlay comes up and the ring lights. Say something, tap the paper to stop, tap Send: the words appear at MG1's cursor, without Enter, and it says "Typed into <app> on MG1", then lifts.
[phone] With MG1 locked, then with its receiver off: Send says so, the words stay; Send again once it is back types them once. Nothing reaches an agent.
[phone] The file check on the real engine: a copy of the widget under another file name, over a picture, does nothing when tapped.
[phone] Hold the lock button: the agent's overlay is exactly as before, its Send goes to the agent. Move the cat to another panel: the words go with it.
